  "implementation": [
    "Last P stage owns raw first-teacher scores and encodes a bounded immutable handoff on the existing sampled-output ring. Each stage validates context, alignment and the final committed token.",
    "Encoded handoffs release GPU teacher storage; a fresh terminal prefill invalidates the source's previous encoded row.",
    "D reuses the existing cohort selected-layer/head ownership and all-owner receipts. Only the aux owner stores teacher metadata.",
    "PP consensus applies the existing metadata readiness gate before attention TP/CP reductions, preventing early consumption by one stage while another waits for its bootstrap-room metadata.",
    "Capture is allowed for AR Mooncake PD with PP; existing backend permits matching P/D PP sizes or D PP=1. DP/CP, speculation and optimistic-prefill capture gates remain."
  ],
